    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>bubble\u00a0</strong>is a physics-based 2D casual puzzle game where you manipulate and reshape the world to help a fragile bubble rise to the surface. Each of the 3 handcrafted worlds introduces unique mechanics that challenge your logic and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve levels in multiple ways, unlock achievements, and collect skins with special perks to aid your journey. Keep an eye out for hidden secrets and clever Easter eggs tucked beneath the worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Wreak havoc</strong>\u00a0<strong>on various objects in the world along your journey!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700890/extras/df93b48eea3b65541ddf694aca6fd9e2.poster.avif?t=1755366266\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700890/extras/df93b48eea3b65541ddf694aca6fd9e2.webm?t=1755366266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unlock skins with perks to aid you along your journey!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700890/extras/2221d2b23652c700a4db0cf9d99390c9.poster.avif?t=1755366266\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700890/extras/2221d2b23652c700a4db0cf9d99390c9.webm?t=1755366266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Every puzzle offers multiple solutions!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted 